.04,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-3.42,"f_score":9,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 13.5%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $15,931M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 32.5%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.62"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":214.53,"default_fair_val":214.53,"premium_pct":-62.9,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":8.6,"pe_forward":7.6,"pb_trailing":1.7,"pb_forward":1.5,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":1.8,"fcf_to_ev":34.04,"fcf_to_mcap":14.05,"liab_to_assets":32.5,"cash_to_assets":68.8,"current_ratio":2.62,"roe":19.9,"roa":13.5,"moat":{"ticker":"PDD","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"拼多多（PDD）的品牌定價權相對較弱，主要依賴低價策略吸引消費者，而非建立強勢品牌溢價。其核心競爭力在於提供極具性價比的商品，這使得其在價格敏感型消費者群體中建立了龐大的用戶基礎。然而，這種模式限制了其在品牌忠誠度和定價能力上的提升空間。與傳統電商巨頭相比，PDD 的品牌形象更偏向於「物美價廉」，而非高端或差異化。未來若要提升品牌價值，需在商品品質、用戶體驗和品牌故事上進行更多投入，以擺脫單純的價格競爭，建立更穩固的品牌護城河。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings' brand pricing power is relatively weak, primarily relying on a low-price strategy to attract consumers rather than building strong brand premiums. Its core competitiveness lies in offering highly cost-effective goods, which has established a massive user base among price-sensitive consumers. However, this model limits its potential for improvement in brand loyalty and pricing ability. Compared to traditional e-commerce giants, PDD's brand image leans more towards 'good value for money' rather than premium or differentiated offerings. To enhance brand value in the future, it needs to invest more in product quality, user experience, and brand storytelling to escape pure price competition and establish a more solid brand moat."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 在專利和監管壁壘方面得分較低。作為一家電商平台，其核心業務模式並非高度依賴技術專利或特許經營權。雖然平台運營涉及複雜的技術和數據分析，但這些技術的門檻相對較低，容易被模仿。此外，電商行業受到日益嚴格的監管，包括數據隱私、反壟斷和消費者保護等方面，這對 PDD 而言既是挑戰也是潛在的風險，而非構成其護城河。公司需要持續關注並適應監管變化，但這本身並不能形成持久的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings scores low in patents and regulatory barriers. As an e-commerce platform, its core business model does not heavily rely on technological patents or exclusive licenses. While platform operations involve complex technologies and data analysis, the barriers to these technologies are relatively low and easily replicable. Furthermore, the e-commerce industry faces increasingly stringent regulations concerning data privacy, anti-monopoly issues, and consumer protection, which pose challenges and potential risks rather than forming a moat for PDD. The company needs to continuously monitor and adapt to regulatory changes, but this in itself does not constitute a sustainable competitive advantage."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 的用戶轉換成本處於中等水平。對於普通消費者而言，由於其平台商品價格低廉且種類繁多，更換到其他平台的成本相對較低，只需重新搜索和比較即可。然而，對於深度用戶，特別是那些習慣了其個性化推薦、優惠券和特定購物習慣的用戶，轉換成本會有所增加。此外，商家在 PDD 平台上的投入，如店鋪信譽、客戶關係和供應鏈整合，也構成了一定的轉換成本。但整體而言，低價策略使得用戶對平台的忠誠度相對容易受到價格波動和競品吸引力的影響。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings' user switching costs are at a moderate level. For ordinary consumers, the cost of switching to other platforms is relatively low due to the platform's low prices and wide variety of goods; they only need to re-search and compare. However, for power users, especially those accustomed to its personalized recommendations, coupons, and specific shopping habits, the switching costs increase. Additionally, merchants' investments on the PDD platform, such as store reputation, customer relationships, and supply chain integration, also constitute certain switching costs. Overall, however, the low-price strategy makes user loyalty to the platform relatively susceptible to price fluctuations and competitor attractiveness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 的網絡效應相當顯著，尤其體現在其「百億補貼」和社交拼團模式上。用戶越多，平台對商家的吸引力就越大，更多商家入駐帶來更豐富的商品選擇和更低的價格，進一步吸引更多用戶。這種正向循環形成了強大的網絡效應壁壘。特別是其創新的社交分享和拼團機制，鼓勵用戶邀請親友參與，有效擴大了用戶基礎並增加了用戶黏性。這種基於社交和低價的網絡效應，是 PDD 區別於傳統電商的重要優勢。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings exhibits significant network effects, particularly evident in its '10 Billion Subsidy' program and social group buying model. The more users there are, the greater the platform's attractiveness to merchants. More merchants joining leads to a richer selection of goods and lower prices, further attracting more users. This positive feedback loop forms a strong network effect barrier. Especially its innovative social sharing and group buying mechanisms encourage users to invite friends and family, effectively expanding the user base and increasing stickiness. This social and low-price-driven network effect is a crucial advantage that differentiates PDD from traditional e-commerce."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 擁有顯著的規模成本優勢。其龐大的用戶基礎和交易量使其能夠與供應商談判獲得極低的採購價格，並在物流、營銷等方面實現規模經濟。通過「百億補貼」等策略，PDD 能夠有效轉嫁部分成本，同時維持極具競爭力的商品價格。這種規模帶來的成本優勢，是其能夠持續吸引價格敏感型消費者的關鍵。與其他平台相比，PDD 在極致的成本控制和規模化運營方面表現突出，構成了難以撼動的護城河。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings possesses a significant scale cost advantage. Its massive user base and transaction volume enable it to negotiate extremely low procurement prices with suppliers and achieve economies of scale in logistics, marketing, and other areas. Through strategies like the '10 Billion Subsidy' program, PDD can effectively pass on some costs while maintaining highly competitive product prices. This scale-driven cost advantage is key to its ability to continuously attract price-sensitive consumers. Compared to other platforms, PDD stands out in extreme cost control and scaled operations, forming a formidable moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 在獨特地理資產方面壁壘相對一般。雖然 PDD 在中國市場取得了巨大成功，並深入滲透到低線城市和農村地區，但其核心競爭力並非源於特定的地理位置或獨特的實體資產。其優勢更多體現在對中國下沉市場的理解和運營能力上，這是一種軟實力而非硬資產。隨著市場競爭的加劇和線上零售的普及，這種基於市場滲透的優勢可能面臨挑戰。若要在地理或資產層面建立更強壁壘，則需要考慮如倉儲物流網絡的深度佈局或特定區域的獨家供應鏈合作。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings' barrier in unique geographical assets is relatively moderate. While PDD has achieved tremendous success in the Chinese market and deeply penetrated lower-tier cities and rural areas, its core competitiveness does not stem from specific geographical locations or unique physical assets. Its advantage lies more in its understanding and operational capabilities within China's lower-tier markets, which is a soft power rather than a hard asset. As market competition intensifies and online retail becomes more widespread, this market penetration-based advantage may face challenges. To establish stronger barriers at the geographical or asset level, deeper strategic deployment of its warehousing and logistics network or exclusive regional supply chain partnerships would be necessary."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 在營運效率方面表現出色，尤其是在其核心的低價商品供應鏈管理和物流配送上。公司通過精細化的運營和對成本的嚴格控制，實現了極高的效率。其創新的拼購模式和對用戶行為的精準預測，也大大提升了庫存周轉率和營銷效率。與傳統零售商相比，PDD 的數字化、智能化運營使其能夠快速響應市場變化，並以更低的成本滿足消費者需求。這種高效的運營能力是其能夠持續提供低價商品並保持盈利的關鍵支撐。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings excels in operational efficiency, particularly in its core low-price goods supply chain management and logistics. Through refined operations and strict cost control, the company achieves extremely high efficiency. Its innovative group buying model and precise prediction of user behavior also significantly improve inventory turnover rates and marketing efficiency. Compared to traditional retailers, PDD's digitalized and intelligent operations enable it to respond quickly to market changes and meet consumer demands at a lower cost. This efficient operational capability is a key support for its ability to continuously offer low-priced goods and maintain profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 的資本配置能力表現穩健。公司在保持高增長和擴張的同時，能夠有效管理現金流並實現盈利。其對「百億補貼」等戰略性市場投入的運用，旨在獲取用戶和市場份額，顯示了其對增長機會的把握。同時，公司也積累了大量的現金儲備，為未來的發展提供了安全墊。雖然其資本配置的重點仍在於擴張和用戶獲取，但其盈利能力和現金流生成能力證明了其資本配置的有效性。未來若能進一步優化研發投入和股東回報，其資本配置評分有望提升。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings demonstrates sound capital allocation capabilities. While maintaining high growth and expansion, the company effectively manages its cash flow and achieves profitability. Its strategic market investments, such as the '10 Billion Subsidy' program, are aimed at acquiring users and market share, indicating its grasp of growth opportunities. Concurrently, the company has accumulated substantial cash reserves, providing a safety cushion for future development. Although its capital allocation focus remains on expansion and user acquisition, its profitability and cash flow generation capabilities attest to the effectiveness of its capital allocation. Further optimization of R&D investment and shareholder returns could potentially improve its capital allocation score in the future."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 在客戶留存方面表現良好，主要得益於其持續的低價策略和不斷優化的用戶體驗。通過「百億補貼」、個性化推薦和定期的促銷活動，PDD 能夠有效激勵用戶重複購買。雖然其用戶忠誠度可能不如高端品牌，但其極具吸引力的價格和不斷豐富的商品種類，使得用戶傾向於將其作為日常購物的重要平台。此外，其社交拼團模式也通過用戶間的互動，在一定程度上增強了用戶黏性。然而，低價競爭的本質意味著用戶留存仍需持續的優惠和優質服務來維護。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings performs well in customer retention, primarily due to its consistent low-price strategy and continuously optimized user experience. Through '10 Billion Subsidies,' personalized recommendations, and regular promotional activities, PDD effectively incentivizes repeat purchases. While its user loyalty may not match that of premium brands, its highly attractive prices and ever-expanding product variety encourage users to consider it an essential platform for daily shopping. Furthermore, its social group buying model, through user interaction, enhances user stickiness to some extent. However, the nature of low-price competition implies that customer retention still requires ongoing discounts and quality services to maintain."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"PDD Holdings 的業務模式展現出較強的韌性與持久性，尤其是在應對市場變化和競爭方面。其低價、高性價比的定位，使其在經濟下行週期或消費者對價格敏感度提高時更具優勢。創新的社交電商模式和對下沉市場的深度滲透，構建了獨特的競爭壁壘。儘管面臨激烈的市場競爭和潛在的監管風險，但其龐大的用戶基礎、高效的運營和持續的技術投入，為其長期發展提供了堅實的基礎。這種適應性強、能夠在不同市場環境下保持競爭力的能力，是其護城河持久性的體現。","comment_en":"PDD Holdings' business model exhibits strong resilience and durability, especially in navigating market changes and competition. Its positioning of low prices and high value for money gives it an advantage during economic downturns or when consumer price sensitivity increases. Its innovative social e-commerce model and deep penetration into lower-tier markets have built unique competitive barriers. Despite facing intense market competition and potential regulatory risks, its massive user base, efficient operations, and continuous technological investment provide a solid foundation for long-term development. This adaptability and ability to maintain competitiveness across different market environments demonstrate the durability of its moat."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"PDD Holdings 的護城河主要由強大的網絡效應（M4）和顯著的規模成本優勢（M5）構成，這使其在中國的低價電商市場中佔據領先地位。其創新的社交拼團和「百億補貼」策略，有效鎖定了價格敏感型用戶，並形成了難以複製的用戶獲取和成本控制能力。雖然品牌定價權（M1）和專利監管（M2）壁壘較弱，但其高效的運營（M7）和客戶留存（M9）能力，以及穩健的資本配置（M8），共同支撐了其業務的持久性（M10）。整體而言，PDD 類似於一個基於規模和網絡效應的「收費橋」，通過連接海量買賣雙方並從中獲取價值，其核心競爭力在於極致的效率和對成本的把控。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"PDD Holdings' moat is primarily built upon strong network effects (M4) and significant scale cost advantages (M5), positioning it as a leader in China's low-price e-commerce market. Its innovative social group buying and '10 Billion Subsidy' strategies have effectively captured price-sensitive users, creating an inimitable ability in user acquisition and cost control. Although barriers in brand pricing power (M1) and patent/regulatory aspects (M2) are weaker, its operational efficiency (M7), customer retention (M9), and sound capital allocation (M8) collectively support its business durability (M10). Overall, PDD resembles a 'toll bridge' based on scale and network effects, connecting vast numbers of buyers and sellers and extracting value. Its core competitiveness lies in extreme efficiency and cost control.","evidenceHash":"9fd7d5eef055bb7ebc786d443550ede48044c02e412ae5940d4c95b4f04ecb07","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T14:49:01.106Z","evidenceHash":"1af64c8d56e3762d93caa550b7d3eb0eb08bd0eed035be7c8e8641b4f4befc05"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T14:49:01.106Z","evidenceHash":"1af64c8d56e3762d93caa550b7d3eb0eb08bd0eed035be7c8e8641b4f4befc05"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PDD.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PDD.png","website":"https://www.pddholdings.com","ceo":"Lei Chen","full_time_employees":"25474","description":"PDD Holdings, Inc. is a multinational commerce group that owns and operates a portfolio of businesses. The company aims to bring more businesses and people into the digital economy so that local communities and small businesses can benefit from increased productivity and new opportunities. It has built a network of sourcing, logistics, and fulfillment capabilities, that support its underlying businesses. PDD Holdings was founded by Hua Lin Cai and Zheng Huang in 20